Dialogue: 99,0:00:04.12,0:00:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Simt că Nadeshiko \Ncontinuă să mă obosească.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.34,0:00:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar să ai o relație sexuală \Ncu un robot este puțin...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar, stai,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}e drăguț să ai pe cineva \Ncare să te întâmpine acasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.91,0:00:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am întors!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine ai revenit, Akane!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:26.02,0:00:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Retrag ce am spus!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.15,0:00:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai dori cina?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O baie?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.23,0:00:32.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau pe {\i1}mine{\i0}?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se pare că a ajuns în faza \Nde proaspăt căsătorită.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.35,0:00:38.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gata, ajunge.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.28,0:00:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Care-i treaba cu toată \Nmâncarea asta elegantă?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am făcut-o pentru tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai și funcții de gătit?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.32,0:00:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.65,0:00:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am fost programată pentru \Ncomunicare, în special,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.11,0:00:54.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar pot sintetiza informații noi \Nca să îndeplinesc și alte sarcini.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg asta, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.49,0:01:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ai dori să faci prima oară?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:04.20,0:01:06.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă poți mânca pe \Nmine dacă dorești...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.25,0:01:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi mânca cina, apoi voi face o \Nbaie și apoi mă voi băga la somn!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.76,0:01:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am mai făcut o baie \Ncaldă de luni de zile.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.87,0:01:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nadeshiko a arătat că poate face și \Nalte lucruri decât a fost programată.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Poate gândi și \Nînvăța exact ca un om.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.33,0:01:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane? Temperatura apei e potrivită?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.09,0:01:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți amintești că te-am întrebat, nu? \NDupă cină și baie, urmez eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, nu, sunt în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.35,0:01:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-De ce e așa de alunecos?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.82,0:01:40.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am adăugat niște săruri de baie care conțin un agent lubrificant.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.63,0:01:44.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A trecut atât de mult timp de la \Nultima baie încât nici n-am observat!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.15,0:01:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai! Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.28,0:01:48.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.33,0:01:52.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te va lua amețeala dacă \Nstai prea mult în cadă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Există și alte moduri de a ne distra aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.80,0:01:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spre exemplu, așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.12,0:02:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci acesta e planul tău, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.80,0:02:03.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plan? Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.78,0:02:08.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se simte așa de bine când \Ncorpurile noastre ude se ating.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.69,0:02:11.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dar e destul de ciudat...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.20,0:02:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simt cum devin din \Nce în ce mai excitată.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.66,0:02:20.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că ești mai \Nexcitată decât de obicei.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:21.31,0:02:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probabil e de la broasca țestoasă cu carapace moale de la cină.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.21,0:02:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E delicios.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.08,0:02:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atât de mult vrei să facem sex?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.55,0:02:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da. Deoarece...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.14,0:02:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,te iubesc foarte mult, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.52,0:02:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mă iubește? Probabil a fost \Nprogramată să spună asta, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar tu, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu mă iubești?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.68,0:02:56.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.93,0:03:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt mult prea excitată ca pot gândi.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.72,0:03:02.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.79,0:03:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze! Am uitat să-mi mișc mâinile.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.55,0:03:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu-mi vine să cred că m-a făcut să \Nscot acele sunete toată noaptea trecută.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, un e-mail.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.88,0:03:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.52,0:03:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An online meetup exclusively \Nfor sex android owners?
